2.1.x.x Sales Dashboard
a. UI Specifications
<<Sales Dashboard>>

Brief Description
This screen displays a visual overview of sales-related activities for the Sales Staff. It allows the actor to monitor key business indicators such as quotation volume, sales order volume, revenue trend, delivery status, payment status, and top customers/products through 2D or 3D charts. It also allows the actor to filter dashboard data by time range and quickly navigate to related operational screens.

